@KinanaAssetManagement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5096
@AccessToken = <paste JWT from /api/auth/login>

### Health (no auth)
GET {{KinanaAssetManagement_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login (R1.1) - Admin
POST {{KinanaAssetManagement_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@1234"
}

### Login - User
POST {{KinanaAssetManagement_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "user",
  "password": "User@1234"
}

### Current profile
GET {{KinanaAssetManagement_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
